  "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nI’m developing a web application that uses WebUSB to communicate with a USB device.\r\nSuccessfully, I've installed the WinUSB driver using Zadig, and the code runs smoothly.\r\n\r\nI'm concerned about using Zadig by production users due to the potential confusion in selecting the right device, driver, etc.\r\nDoes anyone know if Zadig is commonly used in production?\r\n\r\nDid anyone come up with a different idea of how to handle the need to install the WinUSB driver?\r\n\r\nThank you\r\n",
